摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DeepSeek Harness (DSH) Web 插件: 余额 + 峰谷计价潮汐提示。显示 DeepSeek 账户余额与本会话花费, 并在余额前提示当前峰/谷价格档位、距切换倒计时与使用建议。","id":"gh:1334087234","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-balance-tide","slug":"huanyuLv/dsh-balance-tide","topics":["balance","deepseek","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","pricing"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness (DSH) Web 插件: 余额 + 峰谷计价潮汐提示。显示 DeepSeek 账户余额与本会话花费, 并在余额前提示当前峰/谷价格档位、距切换倒计时与使用建议。"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-balance-tide"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**English** | 简体中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"**DeepSeek Harness (DSH) Web plugin: account balance + peak/off-peak pricing tide indicator.**"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"A live readout row under the composer:"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"Once peak/off-peak pricing takes effect (2026-08-17), the badge and countdown\nfollow Beijing time in"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"ff-peak pricing takes effect (2026-08-17), the badge and countdown\nfollow Beijing time in real time:"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"- **Pricing badge**: `standard` (before 2026-08-17) / `peak` / `off-peak`, judged live in Beijing ti"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"me\n- **Countdown**: time remaining until the next pricing switch, ticking every second — plan your u"},{"id":"p10s3","text":"sage ahead\n- **Balance**: live balance from the official `/user/balance` endpoint (granted / topped-"},{"id":"p10s4","text":"up split)\n- **Session cost**: estimated at current-period prices (reuses `sessionProjections`; same-"},{"id":"p10s5","text":"turn/step samples replace rather than double-count)\n- **Hover details**: full price tables for the c"},{"id":"p10s6","text":"urrent and the next period, the peak/off-peak gap (peak = off-peak × 2), peak windows, and usage adv"},{"id":"p10s7","text":"ice\n- **`?` icon**: opens the official pricing page <https://api-docs.deepseek.com/zh-cn/quick_start"},{"id":"p10s8","text":"/pricing/>\n- **Zero config**: reuses `DEEPSEEK_API_KEY` from DSH credentials — no key in the repo, e"},{"id":"p10s9","text":"ver\n- **i18n**: UI follows the interface language (中文 / English)"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## Peak/off-peak schedule (Beijing time)"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"Per the official pricing page (2026-08 edition, last verified 2026-08-15):"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"- **From 2026-08-17 00:00**, peak/off-peak pricing applies; before that, current flat prices\n- **Pea"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"k windows**: 09:00–12:00 and 14:00–18:00; all other hours are off-peak\n- **Off-peak = half of peak**"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"| Model (per 1M tokens) | Flat (hit / miss / output) | Off-peak | Peak |"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"| deepseek-v4-flash | 0.02 / 1 / 2 | 0.05 / 1.5 / 4.5 | 0.10 / 3.0 / 9.0 |\n| deepseek-v4-pro | 0.025"},{"id":"p15s2","text":" / 3 / 6 | 0.15 / 4.5 / 13.5 | 0.30 / 9.0 / 27.0 |"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"**From npm (recommended)**"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"**From the Git URL**"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"**From a local directory**"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"Restart `dsh web` to take effect. Requires `pnpm` (`npm i -g pnpm`)."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"## Configuration (in `$DSH_HOME/profiles/web/cordis.patch.yml`)"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"When the official prices or the schedule change, override them in config — no need to\nwait for a plu"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"icial prices or the schedule change, override them in config — no need to\nwait for a plugin release:"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"`peakWindows: []` means there are no peak hours at all — use it if the tiered pricing\nis ever withdr"},{"id":"p28s2","text":"kWindows: []` means there are no peak hours at all — use it if the tiered pricing\nis ever withdrawn."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"## Security"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"- **Credentials**: prefer `DEEPSEEK_API_KEY` from DSH credentials. The `apiKey` config\noption is an "},{"id":"p30s2","text":"escape hatch only — it lands in a config file in plaintext, so **avoid it**.\n`baseUrl` must be https"},{"id":"p30s3","text":"; plaintext http is rejected outright (it would put the key on\nthe wire).\n- **Balance endpoint**: `/"},{"id":"p30s4","text":"query-tide` serves your account balance, so readers are checked.\nThe Host must be localhost, an IP l"},{"id":"p30s5","text":"iteral, or a domain registered in `allowedHosts`\n(this blocks DNS rebinding); any request carrying a"},{"id":"p30s6","text":"n Origin must be same-origin (this\nblocks arbitrary web pages from reading your balance). Rejected r"},{"id":"p30s7","text":"eads get a 403.\n- **Error reporting**: the server sends only a small set of error codes to the brows"},{"id":"p30s8","text":"er;\nraw exception text goes to the log, so a custom `baseUrl` never leaks to the frontend."},{"id":"p31s1","text":"## Known limitations"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"- Costs are **estimates** computed at current-period prices; the official invoice is authoritative.\n"},{"id":"p32s2","text":"- For multi-currency accounts the readout row shows the first currency only; the rest appear in the "},{"id":"p32s3","text":"tooltip.\n- `deepseek-chat` / `deepseek-reasoner` are no longer listed on the official pricing page —"},{"id":"p32s4","text":"\nthe static entries in `prices` are a fallback, not a verified quote."},{"id":"p33s1","text":"## Development"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"## Compatibility"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"- DeepSeek Harness `0.1.0-rc.6`+ (web profile)\n- Node.js 20 / 22 / 24 (covered by CI)\n- Cross-platfo"},{"id":"p36s2","text":"rm: pure JavaScript + standard browser CSS, no native modules\n- License: MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
